{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04862","headline":"偶游龙门北溪忽怀骊山别业因以言志示弟淑奉呈诸大僚 · 韦嗣立","name":"偶游龙门北溪忽怀骊山别业因以言志示弟淑奉呈诸大僚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽谷杜陵边，风烟别几年。\n偶来伊水曲，溪嶂觉依然。\n傍浦怜芳树，寻崖爱绿泉。\n岭云随马足，山鸟向人前。\n地合心俱静，言因理自玄。\n短才叨重寄，尸禄愧妨贤。\n每挹挂冠侣，思从初服旋。\n稻粱仍欲报，岁月坐空捐。\n助岳无纤块，输溟谢末涓。\n还悟北辕失，方求南涧田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦嗣立","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04862.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04862","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}